WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.812
This is the heart of the chapter.

2
00:00:01.812 --> 00:00:06.325
Learn's pause script does its job well,
and the code keeps it as the model.

3
00:00:06.325 --> 00:00:08.675
But it records nothing
about what it paused.

4
00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:12.284
So when you resume, Learn's script
turns on every paused group,

5
00:00:12.284 --> 00:00:16.687
including one that was deliberately
frozen before the incident started.

6
00:00:16.687 --> 00:00:20.660
It also falls back to the worldwide
cloud on an answer it doesn't know,

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.213
and nothing makes you
wait before resuming.

8
00:00:23.213 --> 00:00:25.000
The verdict: during recovery,

9
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.650
the questions are what did we
pause, and what was already off.

10
00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:30.310
Only a record answers them.
